	<para style="s1"><verse number="1" style="v" x-unrepresented-source="ה ה" x-unrepresented-translit="āh āh" x-unrepresented-src="WLC.PSA.5.1.004 WLC.PSA.5.1.007" sid="PSA 5:1" />Prayer for protection from the wicked.</para>
