	<chapter number="16" style="c" sid="PSA 16" />
	<para style="s1"><verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 16:1" />Jehovah the psalmist’s portion in life and deliverer in death.</para>
	<para style="d"><char style="w" x-id="t001" x-align="PSA.16.1.a001" x-src="WLC.PSA.16.1.001" x-source="מִכְתָּ֥ם" x-translit="miḵtām" srcloc="WLC.PSA.16.1.001" x-head="true" lemma="מִכְתָּם" strong="H4387">Michtam</char> <char style="w" x-id="t002" x-align="PSA.16.1.a002" x-src="WLC.PSA.16.1.002" x-source="לְ" x-translit="lə" srcloc="WLC.PSA.16.1.002" x-head="true" lemma="לְ" strong="H3807a">of</char> <char style="w" x-id="t003" x-align="PSA.16.1.a003" x-src="WLC.PSA.16.1.003" x-source="דָוִ֑ד" x-translit="ḏāwiḏ" srcloc="WLC.PSA.16.1.003" x-head="true" lemma="דָּוִד" strong="H1732">David</char>.</para>
