	<para style="q1"><char style="w" x-id="t010" x-align="PSA.49.5.a006" x-status="added" x-source="∅" x-head="true">When</char> <note caller="-" style="f"><char style="ft">Or, <char style="it">the iniquity of them that would supplant me compasseth me about, Even of them that trust . . . riches?</char></char></note><char style="w" x-id="t011" x-align="PSA.49.5.a007" x-src="WLC.PSA.49.5.007" x-source="עֲוֺ֖ן" x-translit="ʿăwōn" srcloc="WLC.PSA.49.5.007" x-head="true" lemma="עָוֺן" strong="H5771">iniquity</char> <char style="w" x-id="t012" x-align="PSA.49.5.a008">at</char> <char style="w" x-id="t013" x-align="PSA.49.5.a009" x-src="WLC.PSA.49.5.009" x-source="י" x-translit="ay" srcloc="WLC.PSA.49.5.009" x-head="true" lemma="הוּא" strong="H2967a">my</char> <char style="w" x-id="t014" x-align="PSA.49.5.a008" x-src="WLC.PSA.49.5.008" x-source="עֲקֵבַ֣" x-translit="ʿăqēḇ" srcloc="WLC.PSA.49.5.008" x-head="true" lemma="עָקֵב" strong="H6119">heels</char> <char style="w" x-id="t015" x-align="PSA.49.5.a010" x-src="WLC.PSA.49.5.010" x-source="יְסוּבֵּֽ" x-translit="yəsûbb" srcloc="WLC.PSA.49.5.010" x-head="true" lemma="סָבַב" strong="H5437">compasseth</char> <char style="w" x-id="t016" x-align="PSA.49.5.a011" x-src="WLC.PSA.49.5.011" x-source="נִי" x-translit="ēniy" srcloc="WLC.PSA.49.5.011" x-head="true" lemma="הוּא" strong="H5204a">me</char> <char style="w" x-id="t017" x-align="PSA.49.5.a010">about</char>?<verse eid="PSA 49:5" /></para>
