	<para style="q1"><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 54:5" /><note caller="-" style="f"><char style="ft">Another reading is, <char style="it">The evil shall return</char>.</char></note><char style="w" x-id="t001" x-align="PSA.54.5.a001">He</char> <char style="w" x-id="t002" x-align="PSA.54.5.a001">will</char> <char style="w" x-id="t003" x-align="PSA.54.5.a001" x-src="WLC.PSA.54.5.001" x-source="יָשִׁ֣יב" x-translit="**yāšiyḇ" srcloc="WLC.PSA.54.5.001" x-head="true" lemma="שׁוּב" strong="H7725">requite</char> <char style="w" x-id="t004" x-align="PSA.54.5.a002" x-src="WLC.PSA.54.5.002" x-source="הָ֭" x-translit="hā" srcloc="WLC.PSA.54.5.002" x-head="true" lemma="הַ" strong="H1886a">the</char> <char style="w" x-id="t005" x-align="PSA.54.5.a003" x-src="WLC.PSA.54.5.003" x-source="רַע" x-translit="raʿ" srcloc="WLC.PSA.54.5.003" x-head="true" lemma="רַע" strong="H7451">evil</char> <char style="w" x-id="t006" x-align="PSA.54.5.a004" x-src="WLC.PSA.54.5.004" x-source="לְ" x-translit="lə" srcloc="WLC.PSA.54.5.004" x-head="true" lemma="לְ" strong="H3807a">unto</char> <note caller="-" style="f"><char style="ft">Or, <char style="it">them that lie in wait for me</char></char></note><char style="w" x-id="t007" x-align="PSA.54.5.a006" x-src="WLC.PSA.54.5.006" x-source="י" x-translit="āy" srcloc="WLC.PSA.54.5.006" x-head="true" lemma="הוּא" strong="H2967a">mine</char> <char style="w" x-id="t008" x-align="PSA.54.5.a005" x-src="WLC.PSA.54.5.005" x-source="שֹׁרְרָ֑" x-translit="šōrər" srcloc="WLC.PSA.54.5.005" x-head="true" lemma="שׁוֹרֵר" strong="H8324">enemies</char>:</para>
