	<para style="s1"><verse number="1" style="v" x-unrepresented-source="בְּ הַצּוֹת֨ וֹ אֶ֥ת אֲרַ֣ם נַהֲרַיִם֮ וְ אֶת אֲרַ֪ם צ֫וֹבָ֥ה וַ יָּ֤שָׁב יוֹאָ֗ב וַ יַּ֣ךְ אֶת אֱד֣וֹם בְּ גֵיא מֶ֑לַח שְׁנֵ֖ים עָשָׂ֣ר אָֽלֶף לָֽ" x-unrepresented-translit="bə haṣṣôṯ ô ʾeṯ ʾăramnahărayim ʾăramnahărayim wə ʾeṯ- ʾăramṣôḇāh ʾăramṣôḇāh wa yyāšāḇ yôʾāḇ wa yyaḵ ʾeṯ- ʾĕḏôm bə ḡēyʾ-melaḥ ḡēyʾ-melaḥ šənēym ʿāśār ʾālep̄: l" x-unrepresented-src="WLC.PSA.60.1.001 WLC.PSA.60.1.002 WLC.PSA.60.1.003 WLC.PSA.60.1.004 WLC.PSA.60.1.005 WLC.PSA.60.1.006 WLC.PSA.60.1.007 WLC.PSA.60.1.008 WLC.PSA.60.1.009 WLC.PSA.60.1.010 WLC.PSA.60.1.011 WLC.PSA.60.1.012 WLC.PSA.60.1.013 WLC.PSA.60.1.014 WLC.PSA.60.1.015 WLC.PSA.60.1.016 WLC.PSA.60.1.017 WLC.PSA.60.1.018 WLC.PSA.60.1.019 WLC.PSA.60.1.020 WLC.PSA.60.1.021 WLC.PSA.60.1.022 WLC.PSA.60.1.023 WLC.PSA.60.1.031" sid="PSA 60:1" />Lament over defeat in battle, and prayer for help.</para>
	<para style="d"><char style="w" x-id="t001" x-align="PSA.60.0.a001" x-src="WLC.PSA.60.0.001" x-source="לַ֭" x-translit="la" srcloc="WLC.PSA.60.0.001" x-head="true" lemma="לְ" strong="H3807a">For</char> <char style="w" x-id="t002" x-align="PSA.60.0.a002" x-src="WLC.PSA.60.0.002" x-source="[הַ]" x-translit="[ha]" srcloc="WLC.PSA.60.0.002" x-head="true" lemma="הַ" strong="H1886a">the</char> <char style="w" x-id="t003" x-align="PSA.60.0.a003" x-src="WLC.PSA.60.0.003" x-source="מְנַצֵּחַ" x-translit="mənaṣṣēᵃḥ" srcloc="WLC.PSA.60.0.003" x-head="true" lemma="נָצַח" strong="H5329">Chief</char> <char style="w" x-id="t004" x-align="PSA.60.0.a003">Musician</char>; <char style="w" x-id="t005" x-align="PSA.60.0.a004" x-src="WLC.PSA.60.0.004" x-source="עַל" x-translit="ʿal-" srcloc="WLC.PSA.60.0.004" x-head="true" lemma="עַל" strong="H5921">set</char> <char style="w" x-id="t006" x-align="PSA.60.0.a004">to</char> <note caller="-" style="f"><char style="ft">That is, <char style="it">The lily of testimony</char>.</char></note><char style="w" x-id="t007" x-align="PSA.60.0.a005" x-src="WLC.PSA.60.0.005" x-source="שׁוּשַׁ֣ן" x-translit="šûšan" srcloc="WLC.PSA.60.0.005" x-head="true" lemma="שׁוּשַׁן" strong="H7799">Shushan</char> <char style="w" x-id="t008" x-align="PSA.60.0.a006" x-src="WLC.PSA.60.0.006" x-source="עֵד֑וּת" x-translit="ʿēḏûṯ" srcloc="WLC.PSA.60.0.006" x-head="true" lemma="עֵדוּת" strong="H5715">Eduth</char>. <char style="w" x-id="t009" x-align="PSA.60.0.a007" x-src="WLC.PSA.60.0.007" x-source="מִכְתָּ֖ם" x-translit="miḵtām" srcloc="WLC.PSA.60.0.007" x-head="true" lemma="מִכְתָּם" strong="H4387">Michtam</char> <char style="w" x-id="t010" x-align="PSA.60.0.a008" x-src="WLC.PSA.60.0.008" x-source="לְ" x-translit="lə" srcloc="WLC.PSA.60.0.008" x-head="true" lemma="לְ" strong="H3807a">of</char> <char style="w" x-id="t011" x-align="PSA.60.0.a009" x-src="WLC.PSA.60.0.009" x-source="דָוִ֣ד" x-translit="ḏāwiḏ" srcloc="WLC.PSA.60.0.009" x-head="true" lemma="דָּוִד" strong="H173