	<chapter eid="PSA 88" />
	<chapter number="89" style="c" sid="PSA 89" />
	<para style="s1"><verse number="1" style="v" x-unrepresented-source="דֹ֥ר וָ" x-unrepresented-translit="ḏōr wā" x-unrepresented-src="WLC.PSA.89.1.006 WLC.PSA.89.1.007" sid="PSA 89:1" />Jehovah’s covenant with David, and Israel’s afflictions.</para>
