	<para style="q1"><note caller="-" style="f"><char style="ft">Or, <char style="it">Jehovah is my portion, have I said: That I may observe etc.</char></char></note><char style="w" x-id="t001" x-align="PSA.119.57.a001" x-src="WLC.PSA.119.57.003" x-source="יְהוָ֥ה" x-translit="yəhwāh" srcloc="WLC.PSA.119.57.003" x-head="true" lemma="יהוה" strong="H3068">Jehovah</char> <char style="w" x-id="t002" x-align="PSA.119.57.a002">is</char> <char style="w" x-id="t003" x-align="PSA.119.57.a003" x-src="WLC.PSA.119.57.002" x-source="י" x-translit="iy" srcloc="WLC.PSA.119.57.002" x-head="true" lemma="הוּא" strong="H2967a">my</char> <char style="w" x-id="t004" x-align="PSA.119.57.a002" x-src="WLC.PSA.119.57.001" x-source="חֶלְקִ֖" x-translit="ḥelq" srcloc="WLC.PSA.119.57.001" x-head="true" lemma="חֵלֶק" strong="H2506">portion</char>:</para>
