	<para style="q1"><note caller="-" style="f"><char style="ft">Or, <char style="it">Let him not suffer . . . Let him not slumber that etc.</char></char></note><char style="w" x-id="t001" x-align="PSA.121.3.a002">He</char> <char style="w" x-id="t002" x-align="PSA.121.3.a002">will</char> <char style="w" x-id="t003" x-align="PSA.121.3.a001" x-src="WLC.PSA.121.3.001" x-source="אַל" x-translit="ʾal-" srcloc="WLC.PSA.121.3.001" x-head="true" lemma="אַל" strong="H408">not</char> <char style="w" x-id="t004" x-align="PSA.121.3.a002" x-src="WLC.PSA.121.3.002" x-source="יִתֵּ֣ן" x-translit="yittēn" srcloc="WLC.PSA.121.3.002" x-head="true" lemma="נָתַן" strong="H5414">suffer</char> <char style="w" x-id="t005" x-align="PSA.121.3.a007" x-src="WLC.PSA.121.3.007" x-source="ךָ" x-translit="eḵā" srcloc="WLC.PSA.121.3.007" x-head="true" lemma="הוּא" strong="H3509b">thy</char> <char style="w" x-id="t006" x-align="PSA.121.3.a006" x-src="WLC.PSA.121.3.006" x-source="רַגְלֶ֑" x-translit="raḡl" srcloc="WLC.PSA.121.3.006" x-head="true" lemma="רֶגֶל" strong="H7272">foot</char> <char style="w" x-id="t007" x-align="PSA.121.3.a003" x-src="WLC.PSA.121.3.003" x-source="לַ" x-translit="la" srcloc="WLC.PSA.121.3.003" x-head="true" lemma="לְ" strong="H3807a">to</char> <char style="w" x-id="t008" x-align="PSA.121.3.a005">be</char> <char style="w" x-id="t009" x-align="PSA.121.3.a005" x-src="WLC.PSA.121.3.005" x-source="מּ֣וֹט" x-translit="mmôṭ" srcloc="WLC.PSA.121.3.005" x-head="true" lemma="מוֹט" strong="H4131">moved</char>:</para>
