	<para style="s1"><verse number="1" style="v" x-unrepresented-source="הַֽ גַּם" x-unrepresented-translit="ha gam-" x-unrepresented-src="WLC.PSA.133.1.002 WLC.PSA.133.1.014" sid="PSA 133:1" />The excellency of brotherly unity.</para>
